<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: auto-turret sandbag nest -->
  <FT_Turret_SandbagNest.label>沙包機槍巢</FT_Turret_SandbagNest.label>
  <!-- EN: An automatic machine gun behind a ring of filled sacks. ... -->
  <FT_Turret_SandbagNest.description>由沙袋圍成的自動機槍陣地。造價低、搭建快，但在火力下撐不了多久。可用布料或皮革建造，材料也決定它的顏色。\n它的AI不分敵我，所以請小心它的火力掩護。</FT_Turret_SandbagNest.description>
  <FT_Turret_SandbagNest.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>槍管耐久</FT_Turret_SandbagNest.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <FT_Turret_SandbagNest.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>槍管壽命</FT_Turret_SandbagNest.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <FT_Turret_SandbagNest.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>無法射擊: 需要替換槍管</FT_Turret_SandbagNest.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: auto-turret bunker -->
  <FT_Turret_Bunker.label>機槍碉堡</FT_Turret_Bunker.label>
  <!-- EN: An automatic machine gun inside a solid emplacement. ... -->
  <FT_Turret_Bunker.description>設在堅固工事中的自動機槍。建造費時，但非常耐打。石材與混凝土會建成磚石碉堡，金屬則建成裝甲碉堡。\n它的AI不分敵我，所以請小心它的火力掩護。</FT_Turret_Bunker.description>
  <FT_Turret_Bunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>槍管耐久</FT_Turret_Bunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <FT_Turret_Bunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>槍管壽命</FT_Turret_Bunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <FT_Turret_Bunker.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>無法射擊: 需要替換槍管</FT_Turret_Bunker.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>

  
  <!-- EN: crewed machine gun bunker -->
  <FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.label>有人機槍碉堡</FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.label>
  <!-- EN: A machine gun inside a solid emplacement, worked by a colonist from inside. ... -->
  <FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.description>由殖民者在內部操作的機槍工事。不需要電力或AI核心，因此零件比自動碉堡少，也不會誤傷友軍，但沒有人進駐時不會開火。操作者受到工事保護，只有在又餓又累且附近沒有敵人時才會出來。石材與混凝土會建成磚石碉堡，金屬則建成裝甲碉堡。</FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.description>
  <FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>槍管耐久</FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>槍管壽命</FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>無法射擊: 需要替換槍管</FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: machine gun -->
  <FT_Gun_MG.label>機槍</FT_Gun_MG.label>
  <!-- EN: An fully automatic gun made to be mounted on a turret. -->
  <FT_Gun_MG.description>用於陣地與碉堡防禦的機槍。</FT_Gun_MG.description>
  <!-- EN: machine gun -->
  <FT_Gun_MG.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>機槍</FT_Gun_MG.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Machine Gun Bunker -->
  <FT_Turret_BunkerC.label>機槍碉堡（舊版）</FT_Turret_BunkerC.label>
  <!-- EN: A stationry turret strengthen with materials. Requires steel to refurbish its barrel after heavy use. May explode when damaged. Its dumb AI brain can't be directly controlled, so beware of friendly fire. -->
  <FT_Turret_BunkerC.description>一種用材料加固防護的固定碉堡，大量射擊後需消耗鋼鐵來更換砲管.損壞時可能會爆炸.它的AI不分敵我，所以請小心它的火力掩護.。</FT_Turret_BunkerC.description>
  <!-- EN: Barrel durability -->
  <FT_Turret_BunkerC.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>槍管耐久</FT_Turret_BunkerC.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Shots until barrel change -->
  <FT_Turret_BunkerC.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>槍管壽命</FT_Turret_BunkerC.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Cannot shoot: Needs new barrel -->
  <FT_Turret_BunkerC.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>無法射擊: 需要替換槍管</FT_Turret_BunkerC.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
